WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
(phone buzzing)

00:00:05.978 --> 00:00:07.602
- [Liz's Mom] Hi, Liz, this is mommy.

00:00:07.602 --> 00:00:09.786
It's that time of year again, Christmas.

00:00:09.786 --> 00:00:12.112
I didn't want you to make the
trip all the way home again

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:14.099
so this year I'll be visiting you!

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:16.454
I just got off the plane and got my bags.

00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:18.373
I'm going to take a taxi to your place

00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:20.055
so if you're not home, well,

00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:23.010
I remember where you hid
the key, so I'll be fine.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.372
Can't wait to see you.

00:00:24.372 --> 00:00:25.539
Love you, bye.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:27.567
- Where's the other bag?

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.461
- Hallway closet!

00:00:29.461 --> 00:00:31.247
- Shit, don't forget my
dirty clothes in the basket.

00:00:31.247 --> 00:00:32.664
- That's all you.

00:00:33.688 --> 00:00:34.984
- Hey, babe?

00:00:34.984 --> 00:00:35.817
Can't you just tell your mom

00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:38.320
that you're really into
gaming or something?

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.735
- Get that shit outta here!

00:00:40.735 --> 00:00:44.318
(uptempo percussion music)

00:00:51.298 --> 00:00:52.325
Did we get everything?

00:00:52.325 --> 00:00:53.860
- You mean expunge me out of your life?

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:54.693
I think so.

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:55.860
- She's about to be here.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:56.693
Just go, I'm sorry.

00:00:56.693 --> 00:00:57.697
I'll call you later, okay?

00:00:57.697 --> 00:01:00.100
- Wait, we can't spend
the holidays together?

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:00.983
- I don't know.

00:01:00.983 --> 00:01:02.650
We'll figure it out.

00:01:04.466 --> 00:01:05.299
Bye.

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:24.761
(sighing)

00:02:24.761 --> 00:02:28.282
(atmospheric music)

00:02:28.282 --> 00:02:31.399
- I'm really excited for
this position because

00:02:31.399 --> 00:02:35.566
I love learning new things and
I love working with others.

00:02:37.354 --> 00:02:40.702
I love learning new skills and I work well

00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:44.869
with other people and I
love helping other people.

00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:48.905
I am people's person.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:51.964
I believe that I can make

00:02:51.964 --> 00:02:54.370
a great contribution to your company.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:58.010
I'm very familiar with
what your company does.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:02.177
I'm flexible, energetic, and
have a positive attitude.

00:03:03.406 --> 00:03:06.839
I'm seeking to become
an expert in this field,

00:03:06.839 --> 00:03:09.339
in this position, at this job.

00:03:13.644 --> 00:03:15.732
It has been my dream since I was little

00:03:15.732 --> 00:03:19.362
to sell insurance for your stupid company

00:03:19.362 --> 00:03:21.600
because I want to stay here.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.313
(breathing heavy)

00:03:24.313 --> 00:03:26.311
- Devin, there's no easy way to do this.

00:03:26.311 --> 00:03:29.363
Your work has been great
but we just can't meet the

00:03:29.363 --> 00:03:33.280
minimum salary required
to sponsor you anymore.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.773
And I know the holidays are coming up

00:03:35.773 --> 00:03:37.265
and the timing is bad as shit,

00:03:37.265 --> 00:03:40.410
but we've added a little severance,

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:43.214
you know just something
to help get you over.

00:03:43.214 --> 00:03:44.757
Look, you're a smart guy.

00:03:44.757 --> 00:03:46.133
There's a company out there that you're

00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:48.033
gonna be the perfect fit for.

00:03:48.033 --> 00:03:50.232
You're gonna be like the
Lego that's been missing

00:03:50.232 --> 00:03:54.235
between the couch cushions
for god knows how long.

00:03:54.235 --> 00:03:57.068
You're gonna be good, don't worry.

00:04:01.698 --> 00:04:04.365
(phone buzzing)

00:04:13.247 --> 00:04:16.164
I'm gonna just crash at your place.

00:04:23.338 --> 00:04:24.655
- Nah.

00:04:24.655 --> 00:04:27.213
Remember she threw a bowl
over me last weekend?

00:04:27.213 --> 00:04:29.571
I had to carry her ass all
the way to her apartment.

00:04:29.571 --> 00:04:30.404
I'm good.

00:04:30.404 --> 00:04:31.359
Call me later?

00:04:31.359 --> 00:04:33.859
- I'll talk to you later then.

00:04:39.147 --> 00:04:41.935
(loud slurping)

00:04:41.935 --> 00:04:44.768
(whimsical music)

00:05:00.103 --> 00:05:02.770
(phone buzzing)

00:05:19.949 --> 00:05:21.811
How long's your break, two weeks?

00:05:21.811 --> 00:05:22.644
- I don't care.

00:05:22.644 --> 00:05:24.811
I fucking hate dental school.

00:05:24.811 --> 00:05:25.929
I hate teeth.

00:05:25.929 --> 00:05:27.615
I hate it more than my period.

00:05:27.615 --> 00:05:29.917
- One more semester and you settle in.

00:05:29.917 --> 00:05:31.297
- Settle in for what?

00:05:31.297 --> 00:05:34.243
Looking at rotting teeth every
day for the next 30 years?

00:05:34.243 --> 00:05:35.544
I'm not gonna wake up one day

00:05:35.544 --> 00:05:38.397
and realize the season had
passed on me pulling teeth.

00:05:38.397 --> 00:05:39.917
There's not gonna be any looking back.

00:05:39.917 --> 00:05:43.036
No one on their deathbed goes,
"I should've fixed teeth."

00:05:43.036 --> 00:05:44.479
Fucking threw my life away.

00:05:44.479 --> 00:05:45.908
- At least you have an opportunity.

00:05:45.908 --> 00:05:48.218
I worked my ass off
for the last five years

00:05:48.218 --> 00:05:50.820
and I still cannot live in this country.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.309
You're basically crying
'cause the sky is too blue.

00:05:53.309 --> 00:05:57.976
- I thought your company
is sponsoring your H-1B?

00:05:57.976 --> 00:05:58.809
What?

00:05:59.861 --> 00:06:01.444
Why, what happened?

00:06:04.674 --> 00:06:07.065
Right before Christmas too.

00:06:07.065 --> 00:06:08.075
What are you gonna do?

00:06:08.075 --> 00:06:09.953
- Find a different job.

00:06:09.953 --> 00:06:11.703
Marry a U.S. citizen.

00:06:12.892 --> 00:06:14.109
- Hey,

00:06:14.109 --> 00:06:15.620
if you want,

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:19.787
I could totally marry you and
have an anchor baby with you.

00:06:20.961 --> 00:06:24.081
Yeah, we'll show them what's
up and have a fucking baby!

00:06:24.081 --> 00:06:28.363
And we'll be like, hey, look
at our American baby, bitch!

00:06:28.363 --> 00:06:31.363
( light jazz music)

00:06:34.801 --> 00:06:37.634
(whimsical music)

00:06:48.337 --> 00:06:51.170
(heavy breathing)

00:07:00.487 --> 00:07:03.509
(phone buzzing)

00:07:03.509 --> 00:07:05.926
(chattering)

00:07:19.958 --> 00:07:22.625
(phone buzzing)

00:07:34.781 --> 00:07:38.948
♪ Wishes come true the
same time every year ♪

00:07:42.636 --> 00:07:46.803
♪ When every night twinkles
and you're filled with cheer ♪

00:07:50.891 --> 00:07:54.805
♪ Since long, long ago
we've been hoping for snow ♪

00:07:54.805 --> 00:07:59.337
♪ As we cuddle the whole night through ♪

00:07:59.337 --> 00:08:03.504
♪ On the night when dreams come true ♪

00:08:07.524 --> 00:08:11.577
♪ Songs will be sung and
we'll join with loved ones ♪

00:08:11.577 --> 00:08:14.744
♪ To celebrate to new ♪

00:08:15.874 --> 00:08:20.041
♪ On the night when dreams come true ♪

00:08:22.659 --> 00:08:24.076
- Hi, I'm Claire.

00:08:26.512 --> 00:08:29.262
("Jingle Bells")

